-        $$ E_g = \sum_{u \in \text{pixels covered by } g} \text{Distortion}(u) \cdot C(g,u) $$
-    *   Here, $C(g,u)$ represents the transmittance of Gaussian $g$ under front-to-back compositing, ensuring visibility modulation [S1].
